OL,3,GNEWSADisqualified driver jailed after
OL,4,A130mph pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who led police on a 130mph
OL,7,Fpursuit through North Yorkshire has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for 12 months.
OL,10,FMohammed Muqadas Hussain, who was
OL,11,Falready disqualified from driving,
OL,12,Fevaded officers in the early hours of
OL,13,FWednesday morning after failing to stop
OL,14,Ffor Durham Police.
OL,16,FThe 22-year-old was seen driving the
OL,17,Fwrong way around roundabouts and
OL,18,Freached speeds of 110mph in a 30mph
OL,19,Fzone during the pursuit.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
