OL,3,GNEWSADisqualified driver jailed after
OL,4,A130mph pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FHussain, of Heaton Road, Huddersfield,
OL,7,Fwas arrested after reaching a dead end
OL,8,Fon Blackthorn Avenue in Knaresborough
OL,9,Fand appeared at York Magistrates' Court
OL,10,Fthe following day.
